    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWe are delighted to bring to the market this beautifully finished 3 bedroom mid terrace property with access and ample parking to the rear.The property comprises of a modern open plan living/kitchen/dining area, family bathroom and 3 bedrooms 1 of which is ensuite. Located in Castlegregory village within walking distance of local shops and restaurants and a short drive from Castlegregory beach, making this property ideal for those looking for a family home close to all amenities or for those seeking a holiday home.The property is serviced by oil heating, mains sewage, has double glazed windows throughout.\n\nThis property boasts easy access to local amenities, including a Spar supermarket, pubs, restaurants, and playgrounds, all just a short walk away. Plus, miles of sandy beaches are waiting for you to explore.\n\nThe home's prime location makes it an ideal base for discovering all that the Dingle peninsula has to offer. Enjoy a variety of activities for all ages just a few minutes' drive from the house, such as surfing, diving, fishing, horseback riding, water sports, walking trails, mountain climbing, and a scenic 9-hole golf course situated between Lough Gill and Brandon Bay. The quaint town of Dingle is a 30 minute drive over the scenic Connor Pass and this home also provides easy access to Tralee(25km), Killarney(50km), and Kerry Airport(40KM) ."
      },
