        "Content": "<ul><li>3 Bedroom 2 Bathroom </li><li>West Facing Private Rear Garden</li><li>Located in Castlegregory Village </li><li>Rear Access </li><li>Open Plan Kitchen/Living/Dining Room</ul>"
